5a63.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1524115951,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"感谢乂学教育创始人栗浩洋回复。\n这种进化需要很大的勇气，不过确实需要这种勇气。如果每次决策都依赖原有的能力路径，想必是很难有所突破的；而一旦有了这样的勇气，必定势如破竹，无所束缚。👍 ","like_count":13},{"had_liked":false,"id":249211,"user_name":"李家巷子","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1687726,"ip_address":"","ucode":"9ECB6C8B37DB9C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/c0/ae/96c4d827.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1600505303,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"最后那个ceo就算了，出身论就很可笑，另外看起来对技术指点江山，内行人一看就是非常表面且刚愎，跟这种混，要么就一言堂，要么他就会找到一个大忽悠，自己被忽悠的团团转","like_count":12,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2898391,"avatar":"","nickname":"柠檬K","note":"","ucode":"7217F48FC55912","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":547911,"discussion_content":"你说的太有道理 以后不要明说了\n","content_length":16,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1642930553,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":5853,"user_name":"刘海星","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1069628,"ip_address":"","ucode":"FBD510681AA7B5","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/52/3c/ff4bebfe.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1524047690,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"乂学教育创始人栗浩洋答读者codesve：\n\n我说的进化能力，绝不仅仅只是学习能力。它其实更多的意味着一种自我摧毁和自我扭曲的能力，就好像老鹰要把自己身上的羽毛全部啄光一样，就好像一个打乒乓球的奥运冠军，要学打网球的時候，完全不能用自己过去的套路，不能用手腕，而要用整個腰身的力量一样。他是要改变自己过去的思维习惯，而完全变成另外一种物种。这个时候其实会遇到很多不习惯、不舒适，有趣和痛苦的地方。\n\n所以我觉得学位、证书，这些只是一小部分吧，重要的是在这个学位和证书下，他是否真的学会了知识。甚至可能他只是完全的自学，或者是跟身边的人去学习，也能够完成进化。关键是他自己了解新的知识，同時把自己进化到新的领域里的一些习惯的改变，以及能夠驾驭新的环境。就像是人把自己的手脚都砍了，然后到海里边长出鳍是一样的。","like_count":10,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1085240,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/8f/38/e51c775f.jpg","nickname":"John Bowman","note":"","ucode":"0ADFB9AD6EA3A5","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":367474,"discussion_content":"我看到老鹰这个例子就看不下去了。我不知道是不是人人，但是最少我知道没有这样的老鹰。","content_length":41,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1618371034,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":211895,"user_name":"calvins","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1276186,"ip_address":"","ucode":"42D0DDC24486A1","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/m2baiaoDn4II6piarRCeVK4JGah8gzF0m9J6r35xDTEMUUaUrzf23jhRa0aicTeUXDv29ZkicicaI44Fhfn6NrSeHiaQ/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1588036642,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"人随着年龄来说，精力都在退化，学习能力也在放缓，特别是现在大数据和Ai    代表未来的技术趋势，CTO的技术解决能力在某个领域擅长，不可能面面俱到，所以招人，培养人，协调组织，技术整合，战略规划，培养技术文化体系，才是最需要的，用带兵打丈来说，CTO就是元帅，架构师就是将军，CEO就是皇帝，元帅经验丰富，安排打丈能力强，自己带兵打就不一定了。合适的人，用在合适的地方，这是我理解的CTO","like_count":7},{"had_liked":false,"id":277682,"user_name":"伊利丹怒风","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1042222,"ip_address":"","ucode":"D4C3DC84E7020A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/e7/2e/f317f6ad.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1612515354,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"许总已经是CEO&amp;CTO了，所以七牛不需要CTO....","like_count":5},{"had_liked":false,"id":288946,"user_name":"雨歌","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1196526,"ip_address":"","ucode":"83F52EA1A2462E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/41/ee/4669cf48.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1618796167,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"每家公司情况不一样，乂学教育的也有道理，不应批判，不差钱的玩法很多。同感的有几条：\n1、CTO要理解战略和业务，太对了。纯技术眼光，缺乏系统性的业务理解，单个的产品可能都会有问题。没有系统的理解，技术选型、人才选择、产品定位可能都会走弯路。\n2、自身具有技术能力，并持续进化。专业人做专业事，公司以前有过做交付、业务的管技术，怨声载道，聊无成果。不是迷恋过度管理，就是乱点鸳鸯谱，为了体现工作量而刷存在的决策。\n3 、懂技术才给大家希望。技术人员很宅、很单纯。艰难的任务会让人畏惧，了解大家的领导、不断提升的机会、明确科学的路线、友好的工作氛围，是技术中航行的明灯。\n4、还是团队。团队文化是副产品，具备上面能力的CTO带的团队都不会差。\n最后，强调不要过管理，为了管理为了kpi而管理。真正的目标是实现公司战略，给公司带来商机、利润，给员工带来福利和提升。","like_count":4},{"had_liked":false,"id":303690,"user_name":"吴承阳","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1103264,"ip_address":"","ucode":"28F20FAD288F72","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/d5/a0/576ceeaf.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1626934229,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"\n松鼠AI上了非你莫属，老板的表现真的很差劲了，格局，见解都好水。记得那个北大毕业的学生爆锤他，不长记性啊，还是要爆锤下十亿估值的事情。","like_count":3,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1049047,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/01/d7/f835081c.jpg","nickname":"bin的技术小屋","note":"","ucode":"478603A9AB13B4","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":391221,"discussion_content":"哈哈 原来最后那个栗浩洋是非你莫属那个货啊  哈哈，它出现在这个文章中 就是个笑话","content_length":41,"likes_number":4,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1630336150,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":5825,"user_name":"探索无止境","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1044178,"ip_address":"","ucode":"91D2A9907DFA79","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/ee/d2/7024431c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1524011969,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"文章的编排很不错，从能力模型到CTO谈自身对这个职位的见解，然后再跳出来，用CEO的视角重新审视，赞一个！期待后续文章，各位大咖的不同想法和分享，因为经历不同，这样碰撞出来的东西才有意思","like_count":3},{"had_liked":false,"id":12851,"user_name":"二师哥","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1154670,"ip_address":"","ucode":"3BE4978417F082","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/9e/6e/c4fa7cbc.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1529072674,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"不同的阶段，不同的公司对 CTO 的要求也不尽相同。\n个人觉得，归根到底，就是要\n    ！组建公司团队\n    ！能随着公司成长\n    ！为公司盈利做创收","like_count":2},{"had_liked":false,"id":6175,"user_name":"xgiantpanda","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1010907,"ip_address":"","ucode":"EBCA497B5ECE08","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/6c/db/abb7bfe3.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1524499202,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"CTO之于自己，无论思维与技术能力都要不断更新迭代，持续学习；之于团队，把控技术方案，作好人员与之相关的技术和知识储备，技术方案与人员能力之间无缝匹配；之于公司，更开阔的视野，洞察技术的发展趋势，最终还是以结果为导向，业务营利为目的。","like_count":2},{"had_liked":false,"id":5828,"user_name":"codesve","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1025061,"ip_address":"","ucode":"5618C333E7E47E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/a4/25/30365a63.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1524012139,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"从CEO的角度来看，CTO一定要符合公司现阶段发展；并从多个维度考核：学历背景、技术背景、工作经历、战略思维、学习能力、架构能力、团队建设、衔接能力等等……\n想成为CTO的人，可以如此审视自己，现在能适合于什么类型什么阶段的公司，未来需要补充哪方面的能力。","like_count":2},{"had_liked":false,"id":252953,"user_name":":)","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1239198,"ip_address":"","ucode":"23D505949442B6","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/e8/9e/6550a051.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1602546997,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"换位思考，如果我是CEO，我会需要什么样的CTO?\n1.CTO的本质是什么？帮助CEO用技术的方法，解决公司中的问题。\n2.这里涉及到4个方面:CTO,公司，问题，技术\n3.CTO如何与CEO发生很好的化学反应？必须要很好的沟通能力，快速理解CEO的思路想法\n4.CTO如何与公司发生关系？1.公司的长远战略2.公司的业务3.公司的同级部门\n5.CTO如何与问题发生关系？1.快速理解被动的问题2.主动发现问题3.用技术解决问题\n6.CTO如何与技术发生关系？时间的纬度而言1.用当前的技术解决当前的问题，并最好能够解决将来的问题2.学习储备新技术，新技术战略，解决当前技术不能解决的问题，解决将来可能潜在的问题。","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":200318,"user_name":"thinker","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1107762,"ip_address":"","ucode":"1D9ECA03A28931","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/e7/32/82939538.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1585571971,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"技术沉淀\n人才储备\n用人话把技术说清楚\n","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":123053,"user_name":"歌在云端","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1110238,"ip_address":"","ucode":"1C876780C9D25E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/f0/de/ef564e67.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1565598236,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"我感觉主要五方面\n1.自我学习能力，技术能力\n2.业务能力\n3.搭建团队的能力，能团结周围的人为业务贡献\n4.得有宏观视角，站在公司的角度看问题\n5.预见未来的能力，提前规划好未来可能要做的事不至于到时手忙脚乱的","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":6320,"user_name":"顺耳流","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1058055,"ip_address":"","ucode":"E6EAE6AFC61F2F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/25/07/f49d25de.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1524646049,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"从CEO角度看cto的需求，个人认为也不具有特殊性。角色不同，分工不同，只是作为cto，必须要有管理协调，战略支持的整体能力。不管是初创还是成熟的公司，cto都要依附公司战略做好落地实现。只是随着公司变大，战略布局放大，技术会不断加深分工。cto要有支持成长，技术战略部署的能力。","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":365151,"user_name":"Geek_6cd3b3","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2085649,"ip_address":"湖南","ucode":"1AA20C81C0A54A","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1672197662,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"ceo对公司业绩负责，以此为目标，组织协调资源去达成目标，cto对什么负责呢，做的好与不好，如何评价，这个东西不明确，或说不清楚，最后的结果就是，什么都做不了，架在那里要不到资源，也做不成事。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":198943,"user_name":"geek_46dxh5","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1819495,"ip_address":"","ucode":"DDA572149C40CE","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/AVqAefJCk4FP4I7CjicqrOlyS0frwDXYBHl2dymliauzlNwNg9Bx6phpYQsl6dsUN3Ug6NKNgrMzicKHN1SD3109g/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1585474152,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"CTO需要高瞻远瞩的能力","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":195809,"user_name":"小侠","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1045025,"ip_address":"","ucode":"A35A61061E41B2","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/f2/21/00600713.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1585216357,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":4,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"cto是既要微观，了解技术细节，又要宏观，了解技术发展方向，太难","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":189911,"user_name":"444号便利店","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1126699,"ip_address":"","ucode":"BBF7494979725F","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/piaQFZ0kTaOGBbEE7wcpAJ1OQf3RKoC7HicVsSIHNjKCbklATSXxcTKs0ibyTRwhSzZIWAUz9uEpJaGRRX2t7zdng/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1584581864,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":4,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"用人话把技术的事说清楚，也要让CEO及业务觉得技术是有价值的，不是需求的翻译器，也能为公司创造价值；\n持续学习很重要，但更重要的是学会并且运用。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":68393,"user_name":"清水泉","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1139629,"ip_address":"","ucode":"4840316C1D5BEE","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/63/ad/25e0f9e9.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1550493441,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":4,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"怎么感觉是在说CIO","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":14481,"user_name":"锐","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1110915,"ip_address":"","ucode":"A245BA96C9471F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/f3/83/e2612d81.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1530489336,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":4,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"大佬你好，请问cto 到 4 50岁还能有那么好的学习精力吗？如何保证自己掌握的技术在前沿，谢谢","like_count":0}]}